  "body": "Sharply priced - all offer will be considered!\r\n\r\nIn a market brimming with identical terraced boxes, Bayside Residences offers something genuinely different; there is simply nothing else like it available.\r\n\r\nThese freehold, architecturally designed homes make an immediate impression.\r\n\r\nOpen-plan living, dining & kitchen sit at the heart of each residence, where soaring ceilings, skylights & premium Bosch appliances create a bright, contemporary feel that makes everyday life feel effortless.\r\n\r\nWake up to elevated views over suburban Browns Bay from your generous master suite, complete with ensuite, and watch the sunrise from the comfort of your own home.\r\n\r\nBeyond the spacious bedrooms and generous family bathroom, the multiple versatile living spaces really give you the opportunity to bring your lifestyle to life. Call them what you like: a home gym, media room, study or games room. The layout adapts to your life, not the other way around - a far cry from the rigid, one-size-fits-all floor plans you'll find elsewhere. \r\n\r\nPracticality has also been thoughtfully considered, with internal-access garaging, quality laundry facilities, guest parking always on hand - no juggling, no compromise.\r\n\r\nBuilt from concrete and weatherboard and backed by a 10-year Stamford Insurance warranty, these homes are constructed to last and built to protect your investment.\r\n\r\nThe location speaks for itself. Zoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay & Northcross Intermediate, Rangitoto College, and within walking distance of Bayside Drive Reserve, this is a neighbourhood families choose and stay in. Browns Bay & Rothesay Bay - with their shops, cafes and beaches - are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nTerrace living has become synonymous with compromise - tight spaces, identical layouts, little room to make it your own. Bayside Residences was designed to challenge that entirely. The versatility, the architecture, the quality - this is what terrace living was always supposed to be and proud to own.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.\r\n\r\nSome images have been virtually staged for marketing purposes only.",
